    "Id": "chassisdef_glassspider_GLS-4",
    "Name": "Glass Spider",
    "Details": "Introduced by the Wolf Empire, this configuration fits an XL engine and Supercharger to the standard chassis. In place of the standard Gauss Rifles, each arm carries a HAG 20 which share seven tons of ammunition. Three ER Small Lasers are placed in the right torso. All these weapons are tied into a Targeting Computer. This design is primarily used for anti-aircraft work.\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Quirk: Anti-Air Targeting</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#e62e00>Drop Cost Multiplier: 1.14</color></b>\n\n<color=#FFEF00>Arm Actuator Limits: Left Upper, Right Upper</color>",
    "Icon": "GlassSpider"
  },
