  "StockRole": "Sniper",
  "YangsThoughts": "Descended from the Star League era Galahad, the Glass Spider is a second line Clan Battlemech specializing in anti aircraft and direct fire support duties. A 60-ton mech, the Glass Spider is powered by a 240-rated Fusion Engine and relies on a combination of Ferro-Fibrous armor and an Endo Steel skeleton. A pair of Gauss Rifles form the mechs only weapons and are supplied by 5 tons of ammo. ",
